      "title": "Panthers Pack Oversized Tee",
      "printifyTitle": "Panthers Pack Oversized Tee | Happy Hills Cartoon Game Merch | Run With The Pack Graphic Shirt",
      "slug": "panthers-pack-oversized-tee",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "p": "Join the chase! The Panthers Pack race out of Happy Hills in this bold, comic-style graphic: two big cats sprinting through a sunset scene, with the \"Run With The Pack\" slogan underneath. It's Happy Hills merch for fans of the cartoon and game. It works for everyday wear, game nights and matching family outfits."
        },
        {
          "p": "Fit & feel: Relaxed oversized fit with dropped shoulders for a modern, boxy look. Made from 100% Airlume combed and ring-spun cotton for extra softness. Athletic Heather is 90% cotton and 10% polyester."
        },
        {
          "h": "",
          "ul": [
            "100% Airlume combed and ring-spun cotton (fiber content varies by color)",
            "Medium fabric (6.0 oz/yd², 170 g/m²)",
            "Relaxed, oversized fit",
            "Tear-away label"
          ]
        },
        {
          "p": "For a less oversized look, size down."
        }
      ],
